", \"text\": \"Her appointment is seen as a major coup for the medical center, which has been at the forefront of medical research in South Korea.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to have Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Curtis on board,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Lee Ji-Hoon, Director of Kyung Hee University Medical Center.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"Her wealth of experience and expertise in regenerative medicine will undoubtedly elevate our research capabilities and contribute significantly to the advancement of medical science in Korea.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Curtis, who has published numerous papers on stem cell therapy and tissue engineering, expressed her excitement about joining the medical center.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"\\\"I am honored to be a part of this esteemed institution and look forward to collaborating with the talented team of researchers here,\\\" she said in an exclusive interview.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"\\\"Together, we can make a meaningful impact on the lives of patients and their families.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Data released by the medical center reveals that Curtis's research team has already made significant strides in developing a novel treatment for Parkinson's disease using stem cell therapy.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"The treatment, which is currently in the clinical trial phase, has shown promising results in reducing symptoms and improving the quality of life for patients.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"\\\"Ashley's work has the potential to transform the way we approach disease treatment,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Kim Tae-Hyun, a colleague of Curtis's at the medical center.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"\\\"Her passion and dedication to her work are truly inspiring, and we are lucky to have her on our team.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"Curtis's appointment is seen as a major boost to the medical center's reputation as a hub for medical innovation in Asia.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Her presence is expected to attract top talent from around the world and further solidify Kyung Hee University Medical Center's position as a leader in medical research.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"As Curtis settles into her new role, the medical community in Seoul is abuzz with excitement about the possibilities that her research may bring.\"}]}"
